# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kumo-Tabular (NVIDIA), three sizes. Commercial (OpenMDW-1.1) and ungated, so no licence acceptance is
# involved. The graph takes the tabfm-v1 five-input contract and the ENGINE standardises features and
# target (kumo_tabular_v1_minimal): a skipped standardisation, or a doubled one, would pass the non-NULL
# check and fail the floors. Context rows are in-context values from the same pass (the train_size mask,
# not a second pass), so both halves are checked.
#
# Parity with upstream is exercised out-of-band, where upstream's own model is available
# (tools/export_kumo/tests/test_real_weights.py): upstream's single deterministic estimator vs the engine.
# The published Elo figures are num_estimators=8; this is one.

